@* 🤖 المساعد الذكى P3: صفحة تقرير المساعد /assistant/report/{id} - للتقارير المحفوظة («تقاريرى») وفتح تقرير من المحادثة فى تبويب.
   التقرير لصاحبه فقط (GetReport يتحقق من User_Id)، والصلاحية عنصر قائمة المساعد menuItemAiAssistant. *@
@page "/assistant/report/{Id:long}"

@using System.Globalization
@using AccountModelsLib
@using AccountERP.SharedUI.Services
@using AccountERP.SharedUI.Components.Assistant
@using Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection
@inject LanguageService LangService
@inject IServiceProvider ServiceProvider
@implements IDisposable

<PageTitle>@(_doc?.Title ?? Tr("AIR_PageTitle"))</PageTitle>

<MudContainer MaxWidth="MaxWidth.ExtraLarge" Class="py-4" Style="padding-inline: 16px;">
    <div dir="@(LangService.IsRtl ? "rtl" : "ltr")">
        <div class="no-print" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
            <MudButton Variant="Variant.Text" Color="Color.Primary" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.AutoAwesome" Href="/assistant">@Tr("AIR_BackToAssistant")</MudButton>
        </div>
        @if (_chat == null || !_chat.HasAccess)
        {
            <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Warning" Variant="Variant.Outlined">@Tr(_chat == null ? "AIC_NotAvailable" : "AIC_NoAccess")</MudAlert>
        }
        else if (_error != null)
        {
            <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Error" Variant="Variant.Outlined">@_error</MudAlert>
        }
        else if (_doc == null)
        {
            <div style="text-align:center;padding:48px;"><MudProgressCircular Indeterminate="true" Color="Color.Primary" /></div>
        }
        else
        {
            <AiReportView Doc="_doc" ShowOpenPage="false" DocChanged="d => _doc = d" />
        }
    </div>
</MudContainer>

@code {
    [Parameter] public long Id { get; set; }

    private AssistantSessionService? _chat;
    private AiReportDoc? _doc;
    private string? _error;
    private long _loaded;

    protected override void OnInitialized()
    {
        _chat = ServiceProvider.GetService<AssistantSessionService>();
        LangService.OnLanguageChanged += OnChanged;
    }

    protected override async Task OnParametersSetAsync()
    {
        if (_chat == null || !_chat.HasAccess || _loaded == Id) return;
        _loaded = Id; _doc = null; _error = null;
        try { _doc = await _chat.GetReportAsync(Id); }
        catch (Exception ex) { _error = ex.Message; }
    }

    private void OnChanged() => InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);
    public void Dispose() => LangService.OnLanguageChanged -= OnChanged;

    private string Tr(string key, params object[] args)
    {
        var previousCulture = CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture;
        try
        {
            CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture = LangService.CurrentCultureInfo;
            return Lang[key, args];
        }
        finally
        {
            CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture = previousCulture;
        }
    }
}
